acy`), and the `cTUSD` contract holds a balance of this legacy token, the `sweepToken` function will transfer this balance to the caller (the attacker) instead of the admin.", "ai_mitigation": [], "ai_root_cause": "Missing access control and validation in the `sweepToken` function.", "ai_vulnerability_type": "Unrestricted Functionality", "attack_title": "CompoundTusd_exp", "contracts": [{"abi_available": true, "address": "0x12392f67bdf24fae0af363c24ac620a2f67dad86", "artifact_dir": "data/contracts/2022_03_compoundtusd/contracts/01_vulnerable_12392f67_cerc20delegator", "bytecode_available": true, "chain": {"id": 1, "name": "Ethereum"}, "compiler_version": "v0.5.17+commit.d19bba13", "contract_name": "CErc20Delegator", "explorer_url": "https://etherscan.io/address/0x12392f67bdf24fae0af363c24ac620a2f67dad86", "fetch_error": null, "is_verified": true, "proxy": {"admin_address": null, "implementation_address": "0x3363bae2fc44da742df13cd3ee94b6bb868ea376", "is_proxy": true, "proxy_type": "EIP1967", "resolution_depth": 1, "resolved_at": "2026-04-10T06:32:55.074Z"}, "role": "vulnerable", "source_available": true, "source_files": ["data/contracts/2022_03_compoundtusd/contracts/01_vulnerable_12392f67_cerc20delegator/sources/contracts/CErc20Delegator.sol", "data/contracts/2022_03_compoundtusd/contracts/01_vulnerable_12392f67_cerc20delegator/sources/contracts/CTokenInterfaces.sol", "data/contracts/2022_03_compoundtusd/contracts/01_vulnerable_12392f67_cerc20delegator/sources/contracts/ComptrollerInterface.sol", "data/contracts/2022_03_compoundtusd/contracts/01_vulnerable_12392f67_cerc20delegator/sources/contracts/InterestRateModel.sol"], "source_hint": "AI extracted: The `sweepToken` function in `ICErc20Delegate` (which is likely the Compound TUSD contract) is called with `tusdLegacy` as the token address. If `tusdLegacy` is a token that the `cTUSD` contract should not be able to transfer out, this could lead to an unauthorized transfer of funds.", "verification_status": "proxy"}