{"ai_attack_steps": ["The attacker initiates a flash loan of WETH from the Uniswap V3: USDT pool.", "The attacker uses the borrowed WETH to manipulate the price of the GAIN token on a Uniswap V2 pool (Uniswap V2: GAIN). This is achieved by performing a series of swaps on the V2 pool.", "After manipulating the price of GAIN, the attacker repays the flash loan to the Uniswap V3: USDT pool with the WETH obtained from the V2 pool, plus any accrued fees. The profit from the price manipulation is realized at this step, draining value from the V3 pool.", "The attacker's contract then transfers the profit to their own address."], "ai_attack_steps_text": "The attacker initiates a flash loan of WETH from the Uniswap V3: USDT pool. || The attacker uses the borrowed WETH to manipulate the price of the GAIN token on a Uniswap V2 pool (Uniswap V2: GAIN). This is achieved by performing a series of swaps on the V2 pool. || After manipulating the price of GAIN, the attacker repays the flash loan to the Uniswap V3: USDT pool with the WETH obtained from the V2 pool, plus any accrued fees. The profit from the price manipulation is realized at this step, draining value from the V3 pool. || The attacker's contract then transfers the profit to their own address.", "ai_confidence_has_source_code": true, "ai_confidence_known_pattern_match": true, "ai_confidence_reasoning": "1 verified, 0 proxy", "ai_confidence_score": 0.75, "ai_confidence_verified_contracts": true, "ai_explanation": "The attacker exploited the Uniswap V3: USDT pool by initiating a flash loan of WETH. This WETH was then used to manipulate the price of the GAIN token on a Uniswap V2 pool (Uniswap V2: GAIN). After manipulating the price, the attacker repaid the flash loan to the V3 pool with a profit, effectively draining value from the V3 pool.", "ai_mitigation": [], "ai_root_cause": "The root cause is the ability to perform flash loans on the Uniswap V3 pool, which, when combined with price manipulation on another AMM (Uniswap V2 in this case), allows an attacker to profit at the expense of the V3 pool. The `uniswapV3FlashCallback` function in the attacker's contract is designed to execute the attack logic after receiving the flash loan. The `exploitGAIN` function manipulates the GAIN token price on the V2 pool, and then the attacker repays the V3 pool with more WETH than borrowed, plus fees, leaving the V3 pool with a net loss.", "ai_vulnerability_type": "Flash Loan Attack", "attack_title": "Tx : https://etherscan.io/tx/0x7acc896b8d82874c67127ff3359d7437a15fdb4229ed83da00da1f4d8370764e", "contracts": [{"abi_available": true, "address": "0xc7bbec68d12a0d1830360f8ec58fa599ba1b0e9b", "artifact_dir": "data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool", "bytecode_available": true, "chain": {"id": 1, "name": "Ethereum"}, "compiler_version": "v0.7.6+commit.7338295f", "contract_name": "UniswapV3Pool", "explorer_url": "https://etherscan.io/address/0xc7bbec68d12a0d1830360f8ec58fa599ba1b0e9b", "fetch_error": null, "is_verified": true, "proxy": {"admin_address": null, "implementation_address": null, "is_proxy": false, "proxy_type": null, "resolution_depth": 0, "resolved_at": "2026-04-10T06:36:32.431Z"}, "role": "vulnerable", "source_available": true, "source_files": ["data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool/sources/contracts/UniswapV3Pool.sol", "data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool/sources/contracts/interfaces/IUniswapV3Pool.sol", "data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool/sources/contracts/NoDelegateCall.sol", "data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool/sources/contracts/libraries/LowGasSafeMath.sol", "data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool/sources/contracts/libraries/SafeCast.sol", "data/contracts/2024_02_gain/contracts/01_vulnerable_c7bbec68_uniswapv3pool/sources/contracts/libraries/Tick.sol", "dat