ction allows an arbitrary address to be set as the `to` address, and if this address is controlled by the attacker, it can lead to an unintended transfer of tokens. The `sync` function, when called after `skim`, can be exploited to manipulate the pair's reserves, potentially leading to a drain of funds.", "verification_status": "verified"}], "contracts_dir": "data/contracts/2025_03_uni", "id": "2025_03_uni", "metadata": {"ai_enabled": true, "ai_model": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite|gemini-2.5-flash-lite", "dataset_version": "1.0.0", "poc_parser_version": "1.0.0", "processed_at": "2026-04-10T06:39:02.617Z"}, "num_bytecode_contracts": 1, "num_contracts": 1, "num_source_contracts": 1, "num_verified_contracts": 1, "poc_code": "pragma solidity ^0.8.10;

