e `swapToWETH` function before the initial call had finished. This re-entry allowed them to perform another swap, effectively draining the vault's USDC by manipulating the internal state before the first transaction was finalized. The attacker then used the borrowed USDC to repay the flash loan and kept the profit.", "ai_mitigation": [], "ai_root_cause": "Reentrancy vulnerability in the `swapToWETH` function of the DRLVaultV3 contract. The contract did not implement reentrancy guards, allowing the attacker to call the function multiple times within a single transaction before the state updates of the first call were completed.", "ai_vulnerability_type": "Reentrancy", "attack_title": "Tx : https://etherscan.io/tx/0xe3eab35b288c086afa9b86a97ab93c7bb61d21b1951a156d2a8f6f5d5715c475", "contracts": [{"abi_available": true, "address": "0x6a06707ab339bee00c6663db17ddb422301ff5e8", "artifact_dir": "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3", "bytecode_available": true, "chain": {"id": 1, "name": "Ethereum"}, "compiler_version": "v0.8.24+commit.e11b9ed9", "contract_name": "DRLVaultV3", "explorer_url": "https://etherscan.io/address/0x6a06707ab339bee00c6663db17ddb422301ff5e8", "fetch_error": null, "is_verified": true, "proxy": {"admin_address": null, "implementation_address": null, "is_proxy": false, "proxy_type": null, "resolution_depth": 0, "resolved_at": "2026-04-10T06:39:36.124Z"}, "role": "vulnerable", "source_available": true, "source_files": ["data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/src/DRLVaultV3.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/src/interfaces/INonfungiblePositionManager.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/openzeppelin-co