able_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/v3-core/contracts/libraries/FullMath.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/v3-core/contracts/interfaces/callback/IUniswapV3SwapCallback.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/interfaces/IERC20.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/interfaces/IERC165.sol", "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3/contracts/01_vulnerable_6a06707a_drlvaultv3/sources/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/utils/Panic.sol"], "source_hint": "AI extracted: The `swapToWETH` function in the DRLVaultV3 contract is vulnerable to a reentrancy attack. The attacker exploits this by performing a flash loan, swapping a portion of the borrowed USDC to WETH via a DEX router, then calling `swapToWETH` in the vault. Before the vault can complete its swap and update its internal state, the attacker re-enters the `onMorphoFlashLoan` function via a second flash loan, performs another swap, and then repays the initial flash loan with the stolen funds. The vulnerability lies in the fact that the vault's internal state is not properly updated before the reentrant call is allowed.", "verification_status": "verified"}], "contracts_dir": "data/contracts/2025_11_drlvaultv3", "id": "2025_11_drlvaultv3", "metadata": {"ai_enabled": true, "ai_model": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite|gemini-2.5-flash-lite", "dataset_version": "1.0.0", "poc_parser_version": "1.0.0", "processed_at": "2026-04-10T06:39:40.319Z"}, "num_bytecode_contracts": 1, "num_contracts": 1, "num_source_contracts": 1, "num_verified_contracts": 1, "poc_code": "// SPDX-License-Identifier: UNLICENSED
