ndleDepeggedCurvePool(lidoPool)` and `ConicPool.handleDepeggedCurvePool(vyperContract2)` under specific conditions. This leads to an exploitable scenario where the attacker can drain funds by calling `ConicPool.withdraw` after these calls, as demonstrated in the `receive` function.", "verification_status": "proxy"}, {"abi_available": true, "address": "0x635228edaead8a76b6ae1779bd7682043321943d", "artifact_dir": "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3", "bytecode_available": false, "chain": {"id": 1, "name": "Ethereum"}, "compiler_version": "v0.8.17+commit.8df45f5f", "contract_name": "ConvexHandlerV3", "explorer_url": "https://etherscan.io/address/0x635228edaead8a76b6ae1779bd7682043321943d", "fetch_error": null, "is_verified": true, "proxy": {"admin_address": null, "implementation_address": null, "is_proxy": false, "proxy_type": null, "resolution_depth": 0, "resolved_at": "2026-04-10T06:42:16.173Z"}, "role": "helper", "source_available": true, "source_files": ["data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/ConvexHandlerV3.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/SafeERC20.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/IERC20.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/draft-IERC20Permit.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/Address.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/IConvexHandler.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/ILpToken.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/IERC20Metadata.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_exp2/contracts/02_helper_635228ed_convexhandlerv3/sources/IOwnable.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_conic_ex