3D831ec7) to a specified `allowee`. The attacker deployed a contract that called `tokenAllowAll` on the `USDTStakingContract28` to grant itself unlimited allowance for USDT. After obtaining the unlimited allowance, the attacker's contract then called the `transferFrom` function on the USDT token contract to transfer all USDT from the staking contract to the attacker's address.", "ai_mitigation": [], "ai_root_cause": "The `tokenAllowAll` function in the `USDTStakingContract28` contract lacks proper access control. It is a public function that allows any address to call it and set an arbitrary allowance for the USDT token to any `allowee`. This function should have been restricted to only be callable by the contract owner or an authorized administrator to prevent unauthorized allowance grants.", "ai_vulnerability_type": "Access Control", "attack_title": "Contract : https://etherscan.io/address/0xb754ebdba9b009113b4cf445a7cb0fc9227648ad", "contracts": [{"abi_available": true, "address": "0x800cfd4a2ba8ce93ea2cc814fce26c3635169017", "artifact_dir": "data/contracts/2023_07_usdtstakingcontract28/contracts/01_vulnerable_800cfd4a_usdtstakingcontract28", "bytecode_available": true, "chain": {"id": 1, "name": "Ethereum"}, "compiler_version": "v0.7.6+commit.7338295f", "contract_name": "USDTStakingContract28", "explorer_url": "https://etherscan.io/address/0x800cfd4a2ba8ce93ea2cc814fce26c3635169017", "fetch_error": null, "is_verified": true, "proxy": {"admin_address": null, "implementation_address": null, "is_proxy": false, "proxy_type": null, "resolution_depth": 0, "resolved_at": "2026-04-10T06:42:20.149Z"}, "role": "vulnerable", "source_available": true, "source_files": ["data/contracts/2023_07_usdtstakingcontract28/contracts/01_vulnerable_800cfd4a_usdtstakingcontract28/sources/Address.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_usdtstakingcontract28/contracts/01_vulnerable_800cfd4a_usdtstakingcontract28/sources/BUSD_staking.sol", "data/contracts/2023_07_usdtstakingcontract28/contracts/01_v